  "description": "After failing to ascend, Mu-hwa, an imugi, lives on as Mu-sanghyeonsa, the village’s guardian deity. One day, an utterly unnecessary bride is offered to him. The groom(?) Jin-yo is far too sturdy by any measure and seems to be approaching with some kind of ulterior motive.\n\n*“Is tonight our first night…?”*\n\nRegardless of Mu-hwa’s wish to help him recuperate in body and mind and then send him back, the so-called bride looks fully intent on settling in for good…!\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/SinhonJOA/), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/sinhonjoa), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000066030), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11762915), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65530770), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=250581)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/shinkonsuki), [Lezhin](https://lezhin.jp/comic/shinkonsuki), [cmoa](https://www.cmoa.jp/title/338403/)",
